# the same read without guesses, and without direct calls: no typed form reads such a slot, and the read stays as written
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all-Guesses
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK-NOT: GetSlotGetter
# CHECK: = PropGet {{*}}key="a"
# RUN(CALLS): walk f2 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers+TypedSlots+Guesses
# CALLS-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CALLS-NOT: GetSlotGetter
# CALLS: = PropGet {{*}}key="a"
# PROGRAM-OF: getter-in-a-slot-is-loaded-and-called.ir
